===''[[Disney Sorcerer's Arena]]''===
Tigger appears as an Offense Hero, belonging to the Wilds and Forest factions, added in to coincide with the seasonal "''Oh Bothe''r" event. Tigger's central mechanic revolves around building up charges whenever he avoids taking damage. As Tigger earns these charges, his Speed and Evasion stats increase, allowing him to reach his turn faster and continue avoiding attacks effortlessly, and directly boosts his bouncing abilities to give him even more damage output. Tigger additionally has unique synergy with the rest of the ''Winnie the Pooh'' cast that allows him to hit more often and call in assists. In order to unlock and upgrade Tigger, the player must play the seasonal "''Oh Bother"'' event and build a team of Eeyore, a selection of Forest characters (such as Robin Hood, [[Sheriff of Nottingham|the Sheriff of Nottingham]], [[Sven]], or [[Mor'du]]), and the Hunny Pot spell, and complete Tigger's Event Campaign, ''"Bouncing Battle"''. Tigger is also fully required in order to complete Winnie the Pooh's Event Campaign, ''"Bothersome Blitz"''.
